              <p class="text-sm tracking-[0.37px] text-[#76b0de]">03</p>
              <p class="text-xl md:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[0.8px]">Organisation</p><img
                src="./assets/organisation-ca2029a1.png" alt="Blur" class="absolute bottom-0">
            </div>
            <div
              class="bg-gradient-to-b from-[#11314a] to-[#0c2539] overflow-hidden border border-[#224765] rounded-[10px] p-8 relative">
              <p class="text-sm tracking-[0.37px] text-[#76b0de]">04</p>
              <p class="text-xl md:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[0.8px]">Number 1</p><img
                src="./assets/number1-69e48966.png" alt="Blur" class="absolute bottom-0 right-0">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full max-w-[1240px] px-5 mx-auto flex max-lg:flex-col items-center gap-5" id="tech"><img
              src="./assets/control-25bf9a3d.png" alt="Control" class="w-full">
            <div>
              <p class="font-medium text-2xl md:text-[40px] md:leading-[54px] tracking-[0.82px] mb-2">Maintain Control
                Over Your Business &amp; Your Assets</p>
              <p class="max-md:text-sm leading-[24px] tracking-[0.82px] mb-6">A decentralized autonomous organization,
                sometimes called a decentralized autonomous corporation, is an organization managed in whole or in part
                by decentralized computer program, with voting and operations handled through a blockchain. In general
                terms, DAOs are member-owned communities without a centralized leadership &amp; body.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full max-w-[1240px] px-5 mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-[30px] mt-14 md:mt-[84px]"
            id="dao">
            <div class="lg:ml-5">
              <p class="text-[72px] font-medium leading-[88px] tracking-[0.82px] text-[#76b0de33]">01</p>
              <p class="text-2xl tracking-[0.82px] leading-[32px] -mt-9 ml-[30px] mb-3">What Is a Decentralized
                Autonomous Organization (DAO)?</p>
              <p class="max-md:text-sm tracking-[0.82px] leading-[24px] ml-[30px]">A decentralized autonomous
                organization, sometimes called a decentralized autonomous corporation, is an organization managed in
                whole or in part by decentralized computer program, with voting and operations handled through a
                blockchain. In general terms, DAOs are member-owned communities without a centralized leadership &amp;
                body.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="lg:ml-16">
              <p class="text-[72px] font-medium leading-[88px] tracking-[0.82px] text-[#76b0de33]">02</p>
              <p class="text-2xl tracking-[0.82px] leading-[32px] -mt-9 ml-[30px] mb-3">Why make an organization like
                the DAO1?</p>
              <p class="max-md:text-sm tracking-[0.82px] leading-[24px] ml-[30px]">The developers of the DAO believed
                they could eliminate human error or manipulations of its users and funds, by placing decision-making
                power into the hands of an automated system and a crowdsourced process. Fueled by AVAX, the DAO1 is
                designed to allow users to send value privately &amp; securely from anywhere in the world.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="lg:ml-5">
              <p class="text-[72px] font-medium leading-[88px] tracking-[0.82px] text-[#76b0de33]">03</p>
              <p class="text-2xl tracking-[0.82px] leading-[32px] -mt-9 ml-[30px] mb-3">Next Generation Privacy</p>
              <p class="max-md:text-sm tracking-[0.82px] leading-[24px] ml-[30px]">One of the major features of digital
                currencies is that they are decentralized. This means they are not controlled by a single institution
                like a government or central bank, but instead are divided among a variety of computers, networks, and
                nodes. In many cases, virtual currencies make use of this decentralized status to attain levels of
                privacy and security that are typically unavailable to standard businesses and their operations.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="lg:ml-16">
              <p class="text-[72px] font-medium leading-[88px] tracking-[0.82px] text-[#76b0de33]">04</p>
              <p class="text-2xl tracking-[0.82px] leading-[32px] -mt-9 ml-[30px] mb-3">The DAO1 Model is the
                organization of the Future, Today!</p>
              <p class="max-md:text-sm tracking-[0.82px] leading-[24px] ml-[30px]">With the rising optimism &amp;
                increased use of independent decentralized communities &amp; platforms, the DAO1 model is quickly
                growing in prominence and promise as a preferred model for an organization of the future.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
